    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Callas duel",
        "trial by combat",
        "Clorinde duel"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Callas"
      ],
      "comment": "Callas: Callas and Clorinde's duel",
      "content": "Callas opted for a duel with the Champion Duelist Clorinde instead of standing trial at the Opera Epiclese, and asked her to look after his daughter before it began. He did not yield even when wounded, knowing that Clorinde's honour would then require her to finish the duel. Clorinde swore later that he never intended to leave the ring alive. The duel left Navia with years of confusion and a strained relationship with Clorinde, because Callas had told her nothing.",
