    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Sinthe",
        "Marcel",
        "Vacher"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Callas"
      ],
      "comment": "Callas: Sinthe and Marcel",
      "content": "Sinthe, sold in Poisson, was Primordial Seawater watered down, with severe long-term effects on drinkers. Callas banned it. Marcel, who owed his business to Callas and professed loyalty, was secretly behind it. Callas's silence kept Navia safe: Marcel did not move against her for years because Callas's associates held information they could pass to the authorities if she were harmed.",
