      "key": [
        "Callas Line",
        "Clementine Line",
        "aquabus"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Callas: Aquabus and the Callas Line",
      "content": "The Spina sponsored the construction of Fontaine's aquabus system at Callas's urging. The Callas Line is named for him, the Clementine Line for his wife and the Navia Line for his daughter. The Callas Line, which ran to the Fontaine Research Institute, is out of service.",
